{"id":"d7f782c53fc50060","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-irredundant.md","title":"Prime and irredundant DNF families","display":"df-irredundant — Prime and irredundant DNF families","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-irredundant","aliases":["27-df-irredundant"],"display":"df-irredundant — Prime and irredundant DNF families","depends_on":["[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-piset]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§1.7 Definition 1.20; §3.3","source_printed_pages":"27–28, 142","source_pdf_pages":"51–52, 166","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-irredundant"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-irredundant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-irredundant — Prime and irredundant DNF families"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.7 Definition 1.20; §3.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"27–28, 142"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"51–52, 166"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimeDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid D\\subseteq\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PrimeDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid D\\subseteq\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IrredDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f\\land\\forall T\\in D\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D\\setminus\\{T\\})\\ne f)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IrredDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f\\land\\forall T\\in D\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D\\setminus\\{T\\})\\ne f)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimeIrredDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PrimeDNF}(f)\\cap\\mathrm{IrredDNF}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PrimeIrredDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PrimeDNF}(f)\\cap\\mathrm{IrredDNF}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>prime 检查每项能否删文字，irredundant 检查能否删整项；两个条件不同，且都不等同于全局 minimum。空 DNF 是常 0 函数的 prime irredundant 表示。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 与 $\\mathrm{PI}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]、[[27-df-piset]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 与 $\\mathrm{PI}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]、[[27-df-piset]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimeDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid D\\subseteq\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IrredDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f\\land\\forall T\\in D\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D\\setminus\\{T\\})\\ne f)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimeIrredDNF}(f)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PrimeDNF}(f)\\cap\\mathrm{IrredDNF}(f).","display":true}],"bytes":1434,"backlinks":[{"id":"25e15a85dc4e265d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathrm{PrimeDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-irredundant]]，$\\operatorname{lc}$ 见 [[27-df-dnfcost]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-247","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-irredundant|df-irredundant — Prime and irredundant DNF families]]"},{"id":"107965fb6156fc4c","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"目录中仍可定位的主要约定入口是 [[27-df-hornfunc]]、[[27-df-monotone]]、[[27-df-unate]]、[[27-df-quadfunc]]、[[27-df-quadpb]]、[[27-df-mindnf]] 与 [[27-df-irredundant]]。这些节点分别保留 Horn 的零方程约定、正性与 unate 的区别、两种二次性，以及最少表示与不可约表示的区别。各节点中的旧来源字段只作为原附件的来源记录保留；缺少对应 PDF 时，字段存在不等于本次已核验源文。"},{"id":"f6ca44d32813c27a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；各表示族见 [[27-df-irredundant]]、[[27-df-mindnf]]。"}],"outgoing":["0b618255959ff4bc","3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2"]}